### Skapa ny kund lokalt

POST https://localhost:8000/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19000101-9999",
  "name": "Test Person",
  "annualIncome": 450000,
  "totalDebt": 100000
}

### Uppdatera kund lokalt

PUT https://localhost:8000/api/customers/19000101-9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "annualIncome": 10000000,
  "totalDebt": 10000
}

### Kontrollera uppdaterat Credit Score

GET https://localhost:8000/api/customers/19951212-1234/credit-score

### Uppdatera kund som inte finns

PUT https://localhost:8000/api/customers/19000101-9999
Content-Type: application/json

